T* (Rs 70-75 in gross contribution.) Tj
T* (3. The High-Value Polyclinic Leverage: Onboarding just 60 polyclinics \(Tier 3\) alone yields ~Rs 10 Lakhs in annual net profit, making enterprise clinic acquisition exceptionally high) Tj
